-- a chunk of a file's records, in a process of its own (the machine keeps what a process builds
-- until it ends, so each chunk is its own process): the record the last chunk ended inside
-- (build/etym/tmp/carry) and this chunk read, their lines appended to the index, what is left kept
e-open-app : List Word → Proc W Word
e-open-app p = bind (h-cstr p) (λ c → sys-call #2 c #1089 #420 #0 #0 #0)
